Privacy Policy

Effective Date: August 30, 2026

Overview

This extension is designed to process images and PDF files entirely
within your web browser. We respect your privacy and do not collect,
store, transmit, or sell your personal information.

Data Collection

This extension does not collect any personal data, browsing history,
account information, file contents, or analytics.

Local Processing

All image and PDF conversion, compression, editing, and related
operations are performed locally on your device. Your files are not
uploaded to our servers or any third-party service.

Permissions

The permissions requested by the extension are used solely to provide
its functionality, such as saving processed files, storing user
preferences locally, and accessing the active page only when you
explicitly use the extension.

Third-Party Services

This extension does not use third-party services to process your files
and does not share your data with third parties.

Data Security

Because processing occurs locally, your files remain under your control
and never leave your device unless you choose to share them yourself.

Changes

We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be
reflected in an updated version of this document.

Contact

If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact the
extension developer through the contact information provided on the
Chrome Web Store listing.
